{'symbol': 'WST', 'date': '2022-05-23 16:30:00', 'title': 'WEST TO ATTEND AND SHOWCASE INDUSTRY LEADERSHIP IN PACKAGING AND CONTAINMENT AT INTERPHEX 2022', 'text': 'WEST TO PRESENT ON INDUSTRY TRENDS, ENABLING TECHNOLOGIES, PACKAGING COMPONENTS, AND INNOVATIVE DELTACUBE™\xa0MODELING PLATFORM EXTON, PA. , MAY 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: WST), A GLOBAL LEADER IN INNOVATIVE SOLUTIONS FOR INJECTABLE DRUG ADMINISTRATION, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS PARTICIPATION AT INTERPHEX 2022 TO SHOWCASE ITS LEADERSHIP AND EXPERTISE ON INDUSTRY CHALLENGES AND TRENDS IN PACKAGING AND CONTAINMENT.'}